Usage: repovec-ci [docs-gate] [--changed-file <path> [--changed-file <path>]...] [--help]
       repovec-ci [docs-gate] --stdin
       repovec-ci systemd-gate

Reads a changed-file list and prints documentation-gate decisions in
GitHub Actions output format, or validates checked-in systemd units and
the appliance directory-layout assets.
